---
description: Enforce stable success and failure envelopes for every Cleanora API.
globs: "{src/**/*.ts,tests/**/*.ts,docs/apis/**/*.md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow `docs/standards/api-response-and-errors.md`.
- Success uses `success`, `data`, `requestId`, and optional `meta`.
- Failure uses `success`, `error.code`, safe `error.message`, optional safe
  `error.details`, and top-level `requestId`.
- Do not return raw Prisma records, stack traces, SQL, secrets, tokens, cookies,
  OTPs, password values, or provider payloads.
- Keep error codes stable and test success, validation, authorization, state,
  dependency, and unexpected-failure paths as applicable.
